  "checks": [
    "All bases can be learned without automatic effects or consuming equipment capacity",
    "Equal-performance copies are counted as quantities, not new compositions from identity swaps",
    "The same acquired instance or learned plain option cannot be equipped twice",
    "Distinct equal copies stack within capacity and replace equipment without spending points",
    "Cost, slot, same-kind, role and duplicate-surcharge constraints differ on concrete builds",
    "Over-capacity, missing and unlearned equipment requests fail atomically",
    "Authored costs stay positive and negative affixes do not automatically grant discounts",
    "Selling a selected copy is blocked while an equal unused copy can be converted",
    "Unequipping releases a copy for sale; sale does not erase learning or recreate the copy",
    "Free respec refunds actual payments, removes invalid equipment, and retains possessions",
    "Home equipment survives serialization and cannot be changed during an expedition",
    "Only equipped entries contribute; two equal attack bonuses sum once and remain below the threshold at 90",
    "Conditional bundles preserve their drawback while threshold and healing contributions resolve once",
    "Four placement discounts sum before one minimum-action-cost clamp",
    "Two strong conditional copies cost the entire capacity and reach multiplier two only at the correct excess",
    "Two guard copies read the same pending flag and a borrowed guard re-arms only one shared flag",
    "Player equipment does not contribute to an NPC using the same card"
  ],
